{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791755040, "covers_from": "2026-10-11T21:44:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-11T21:45:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791755100, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-11T21:44:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 51874, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北車站的高鐵座位真的很少座位給老人，位置少到一個不行真的很糟糕。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.51,874", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T21:44:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11911, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望台北市餐酒館不要開在巷弄內，酒客吵鬧影響住戶休息，能否有效改善", "display_name": "士林代表 No.11,911", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T21:44:22+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28211, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "設置公共廚餘機", "display_name": "大安代表 No.28,211", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T21:44:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 61817, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "其他", "content": "修法若屬立委個人權利，就是踐踏專業，難怪您氣藍白，可是黃捷也是如此，您卻視若無睹，專業不敵私人交情？", "display_name": "松山代表 No.61,817", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T21:44:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 61466, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你當選市長，勞工退休金（純舊制）會不會依據勞基法辦理？\n如果不會，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.61,466", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 11911, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.11,911", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 28211, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.28,211", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "f